        "id": 122863,
        "name": "Braithwhite",
        "username": "Braithwhite",
        "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/braithwhite/{size}/1854_2.png",
        "created_at": "2014-12-15T14:33:19.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>\"Checmical Explosion\" is Pike industries new line of perfumes. &nbsp;Early marketing results showed that today's generation of dissafected youth craved a perfume/cologne line that was spelled incorrectly, both so that they could feel superior by pointing it out, so that they could wear it ironically, and so that the resulting viral media surge from the spelling (and the slo-mo videos of the concentrated versions being exploded) would propel it to success. &nbsp;</p><p><span>Underestimate the Chairman's business and marketing acumen at your peril. &nbsp;&nbsp;</span></p>",
